- New, faster main screen: tap to check off, long-press to edit, add items from the bottom bar with suggestions. All list themes (Default, Classic, Bugdroid) are kept.
- Updated for Android 15: targets API 35, AndroidX, Kotlin.
- CSV import/export uses the system file picker and keeps access to the chosen file.
- Fixed crashes in CSV import/export, list sharing settings, automation and the widget.
- Fixed wrong item being moved/deleted after rotating the screen.
- Backups now include the latest changes.
- Smaller app: dead code and unused dependencies removed.
